  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Black Bird Manipulation — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>Beginning 11th level, your mastery of Black Bird Manipulation has made you develop its most powerful technique. As an action for 8 Cursed Energy, you can order one of your crows to launch themselves at a creature from their flying speed range. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take 10d10 necrotic damage and have one of their limbs damaged, rolling a d6 to see the damaged limb. On a successful save, they take half as much damage and do not have a limb damaged. The crow dies afterwards.</p>",
